  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Roughly chop brown onion. Grate carrot.\n• Drain corn kernels. Drain and rinse red kidney beans. Little cooks: Under adult supervision, older kids can help grate the carrot.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6549b5b1f4d088a24da71b82-5aafbc75.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat.\n• Cook onion and carrot until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Stir in garlic paste and mild Caribbean jerk spice blend, and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6549b5b1f4d088a24da71b82-d5012a92.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add basmati rice, kidney beans and corn to pan, stirring to coat. Stir in vegetable stock powder and the boiling water (13/4 cups for 2 people / 31/2 cups for 4 people).\n• Cover with a lid and reduce heat to low. Cook for 16 minutes, then remove pan from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 5 minutes.\n• Uncover, then stir through baby spinach leaves and half the Cheddar cheese. Season with pepper. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6549b5b1f4d088a24da71b82-9ded7aed.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Caribbean veggie and kidney bean rice between bowls.\n• Sprinkle over remaining cheese.\n• Top with Greek style yoghurt and tear over coriander to serve. Enjoy! Little cooks: Add the finishing touch by sprinkling over the cheese and coriander!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6549b5b1f4d088a24da71b82-093426e9.jpeg"
    }
  ]
